WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.609 --> 00:00:25.179
Now let's dig in to vote by mail.

00:00:25.179 --> 00:00:26.480
This is crazy.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.189
Donald Trump has been continuing to attack
vote by mail while drawing a false distinction,

00:00:31.189 --> 00:00:36.870
a vote by mail from absentee ballots while
now telling flitter Floridians that they should

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:37.870
all vote by mail.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.190
So the backstory has been that as the.

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:46.879
Corona virus has raged, voting absentee has
become increasingly important in terms of

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:49.120
safely voting in November.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.980
We have never had a federal election.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.100
Federal presidential election delayed.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.079
We don't plan to do at this time, but we want
to do it safely.

00:00:55.079 --> 00:00:58.370
Donald Trump has come out very strongly against
vote by mail.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.370
And we know why.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:03.530
We looked at a poll on Monday which showed
that among voters planning to vote in person,

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:05.320
two thirds support Trump.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:09.100
Among voters planning to vote by mail, more
than 70 percent support Joe Biden.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.110
So the data's is clear.

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:13.149
It's crystal clear why Trump would oppose
vote by mail.

00:01:13.149 --> 00:01:17.399
Then Trump has sort of either deliberately
or genuinely, you know, we don't know.

00:01:17.399 --> 00:01:21.930
He's been confused about vote by mail versus
absentee ballots, even though what we are

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:27.810
talking about this year is expanding absentee
ballot access to whoever wants one, not requiring

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:29.370
certain conditions to be met.

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:34.770
Fear of catching Corona virus should be a
valid reason to vote absentee, often in real

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:35.770
time.

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:41.030
We started to see over the last 72 to 96 hours
contradictions between what Donald Trump is

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:45.990
saying and what his press area press secretary
Kaili McEnany has been saying.

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:50.830
And yesterday, in the midst of a press briefing
during which Kelly was saying one set of things

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.439
about the fraudulent nature of vote by mail.

00:01:53.439 --> 00:01:58.030
Donald Trump tweets out of nowhere, quote,
Whether you call it vote by mail or absentee

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:02.570
voting, which sort of implies that he's recognizing
it's the same thing, whether you call it vote

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:06.440
by mail or absentee voting in Florida, the
election system is safe and secure, tried

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:11.290
and true what Florida's voting system has
been cleaned up.

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:14.180
We defeated Democrats attempts at change.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:19.380
So in Florida, I encourage all to request
