00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.400
Except you won't accept it.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.120
Only absentee is safe.

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:42.290
Vote by mail is not safe.

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:46.780
Other states like Nevada who have decided
to expand absentee ballot access to everybody

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.600
